### Serverpod DevTools Extension REST Endpoints
@devToolsUrl = http://localhost:8082/serverpod_dev_tools/api

### Get Database Schema Graph (Tables, Fields, Relations)
GET {{devToolsUrl}}/schema

### Inspect Schema Stats (Row Counts)
GET {{devToolsUrl}}/stats

### List Registered Endpoints & Callable RPC Methods
GET {{devToolsUrl}}/endpoints

### Get HTTP Workspace Collections
GET {{devToolsUrl}}/http

### Get Mock Data Seeding Dependency Order (Topological Sort)
GET {{devToolsUrl}}/order
